  <p class="note-line">
    These are advertised prices from provider and course-guide pages, not proof of quality. The Power BI middle value is
    the median of the 14 listed starting fees. Course-guide pages also print fresher-salary figures with no employer
    data behind them, so ignore those. Naukri Campus (January 2025) puts overall BCom fresher starting pay at roughly
    Rs 2.5 lakh to Rs 5 lakh a year across all industries and roles, not per certificate.
  </p>

  <p>
    A higher fee may buy live practice, a mentor, or a project review. Ask for exactly that. If the
    extra money buys only a different logo on the paper, choose the cheaper one.
  </p>

